<doc id="40416" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=40416" title="Dardania">
Dardania

Dardania () iku sawijining suku kuna ing Balkan, asal saka &lt;a href="Illyrians"&gt;Illyrian&lt;/a&gt;. Ibukuthané dipercaya sing arané &lt;a href="Damastion"&gt;Damastion&lt;/a&gt; cedhak &lt;a href="Tlaga%20Ohrid"&gt;Tlaga Ohrid&lt;/a&gt; Ing abad kaping-1 sadurungé Masehi, Dardania nyerang provinsi Macedonia (provinsi Romawi) karo &lt;a href="Scordisci"&gt;Scordisci&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Maedi"&gt;Maedi&lt;/a&gt;. Ing abad kaping-6, dikuwasani déning Roma lan dadi péranganing provinsi &lt;a href="Moesia%20Superior"&gt;Moesia Superior&lt;/a&gt;, saiki &lt;a href="Kosovo"&gt;Kosovo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Serbia"&gt;Serbia&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Bulgaria"&gt;Bulgaria&lt;/a&gt; lor. Miturut &lt;a href="Strabo"&gt;Strabo&lt;/a&gt;, tlaytah iki dipérang dadi rong sub-grup, yakuwi &lt;a href="Galabri"&gt;Galabri&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Thunaki"&gt;Thunaki&lt;/a&gt;.
