Thesaloniki

Thessaloniki utawa Tesalonika (&lt;a href="basa%20Yunani"&gt;Yunani&lt;/a&gt;: Θεσσαλονίκη, &lt;a href="basa%20Turki"&gt;Turki&lt;/a&gt;: Selânik, &lt;a href="basa%20Slavia"&gt;Slavia&lt;/a&gt;: Solun (Солун), &lt;a href="basa%20Aromanian%20language"&gt;Aromania&lt;/a&gt;: Săruna, &lt;a href="basa%20Ladino"&gt;Ladino&lt;/a&gt;: Selanik), iku sawijining &lt;a href="kutha"&gt;kutha&lt;/a&gt; kang dumunung ing &lt;a href="Yunani"&gt;Yunani&lt;/a&gt; pérangan lor. Sing ndunungi gunggung 363.987 jiwa (&lt;a href="2001"&gt;2001&lt;/a&gt;).
