Indiana wewatesan karo 4 praja liyané yaiku. &lt;a href="Illinois"&gt;Illinois&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kentucky"&gt;Kentucky&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Michigan"&gt;Michigan&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Ohio"&gt;Ohio&lt;/a&gt; Praja iki uga wewatesan karo &lt;a href="Tlaga%20Michigan"&gt;Tlaga Michigan&lt;/a&gt; yaiku péranganing Tlaga &lt;a href="Great%20Lake"&gt;Great Lake&lt;/a&gt; sing sakabèhané dumunung ana ing sajeroné nagara Amérika Sarékat.
